OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright and feeling pleasant in any
OL,7,Fsunshine. Isolated showers possible,
OL,8,Fthese most likely across Moray. Breezy
OL,9,Fat times around North Sea coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe cloud thickening with
OL,12,Fpatchy rain at times during this
OL,13,Fevening, skies then clearing overnight
OL,14,Fand turning chilly by dawn with a
OL,15,Ftouch of frost possible.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith sunny spells, although there will
OL,19,Fbe a scattering of showers. Light or
OL,20,Fmoderate northwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
