OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,7,Fpressure dominates. Mostly cloudy on
OL,8,FTuesday and Wednesday with patchy
OL,9,Flight rain or showers possible.
